From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Koushick Varun <51849493+kvarun-p@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:37:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] nvk: macOS port on the NVBringup kext (nvkmd/macos)

- nvkmd/macos: nvkmd backend over libnvmac (IOKit user client of the
  NVBringup kext driving GSP-RM): memory, VA, timeline syncs, exec and
  bind contexts
- device discovery through vk_instance::physical_devices.enumerate
- nvkcl: the two OpenCL C kernels written with nir_builder (no mesa_clc
  and LLVM on macOS)
- build: skip the libdrm winsys, NAK HW runner bindings and syncobj bits
  on Darwin; link with -undefined dynamic_lookup for weak entrypoints

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
